    "A Chrome window you can watch on %@. What you sign in to there stays.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 上打开可供查看的 Chrome 窗口，登录状态会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chat with new messages opens at the first one, or at the latest. With Send with Return on, Shift-Return starts a new line on a hardware keyboard.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有新消息时，可从第一条新消息或最新消息开始查看。启用回车发送后，使用实体键盘按 Shift + Return 可换行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clean browser on %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
